  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-23\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 23</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-1er\">\n            <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n            <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                <p>Les articles 2, 3, 4, 6,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">7°</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, l'article 7, l'article 8, § 1er, les articles 9 à 10 inclus, l'article 11,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, l'article 12,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, l'article 13,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, l'article 15, 16,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">5°</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>, les articles 17, 18 et 19 ne produisent leurs effets que sur les dossiers relatifs au transfert de droits d'émission d'éléments nutritionnels qui sont introduits auprès de la Mestbank à partir du 14 février 2009.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </div>\n</article>",
